  partId: windows
  displayName: Crew Module Windows
  shortName: Windows
  zone: 0
  order: 40
  keySpec: "Four windows  \xB7  multi-pane fused silica"
  summary: 'Orion carries four windows for docking and for monitoring the vehicle.
    Each is a serious engineering problem: a hole in a pressure vessel that must
    also survive re-entry heating.'
  whyItMatters: The outer pane is a thermal and debris shield. The inner panes are
    the real pressure panes, and each one alone is strong enough to hold cabin pressure,
    so a crack in any single pane cannot breach the cabin.
  narration: {fileID: 0}
